Atech Atelier — third-party components added by Atech
=====================================================

This file covers what Atech adds on top of the upstream FreeCAD AppImage.
FreeCAD itself and the libraries it bundles keep their own licences. FreeCAD's
own list is usr/share/doc/FreeCAD/ThirdPartyLibraries.html (FreeCAD's licence:
usr/share/doc/FreeCAD/LICENSE.html, "LGPL2+"); every bundled package is listed
in packages.txt at the image root, and the licence texts that ship are in
usr/share/doc/<package>/, usr/share/licenses/ and
usr/lib/python3.11/site-packages/*.dist-info/. CREDITS.md lists the main ones
(usr/share/doc/@DOC_NAME@/CREDITS.md). Where to get the source:
usr/share/doc/@DOC_NAME@/SOURCE_OFFER.txt.

FreeCADMCP (the FreeCAD addon half of freecad-mcp)
  upstream  https://github.com/neka-nat/freecad-mcp
  commit    @FREECADMCP_COMMIT@
  licence   MIT — Copyright (c) 2025 Shirokuma (k tanaka)
  installed usr/Mod/FreeCADMCP/
  what it is an optional XML-RPC server, off by default, that lets an
            external MCP client (for example the freecad-mcp MCP server)
            drive the running FreeCAD. Atech Atelier's own chat agent does
            not use it.
  licence text usr/Mod/FreeCADMCP/LICENSE and
               usr/share/doc/@DOC_NAME@/third_party/LICENSE.FreeCADMCP
  MODIFIED BY ATECH. The patches applied to this copy are installed, as
  applied, in usr/share/doc/@DOC_NAME@/third_party/FreeCADMCP-patches/.

Lucide icons
  upstream  https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide
  licence   ISC — Copyright (c) 2026 Lucide Icons and Contributors
  used in   a small set of icon path strings inlined in
            usr/Mod/AcadAgent/acadagent/style.py (PATHS): mostly from older
            Lucide releases (e.g. as in tag 0.400.0), some simplified;
            "chat" is Feather's message-square; "stop" and "tree" are drawn
            by Atech
  licence text usr/share/doc/@DOC_NAME@/third_party/LICENSE.Lucide
               (fetched at lucide commit 66d8f9fc394b8530377e5f6112f0b8908ba01280)

Feather icons
  upstream  https://github.com/feathericons/feather
  licence   MIT — Feather-derived icons: Copyright (c) 2013-present Cole
            Bemis (as stated in LICENSE.Lucide); Feather's own LICENSE reads
            Copyright (c) 2013-2023 Cole Bemis (LICENSE.Feather)
  used in   Lucide icons derived from Feather (the Lucide licence lists
            them) and "chat" (Feather's message-square), inlined the same way
  licence text usr/share/doc/@DOC_NAME@/third_party/LICENSE.Feather
               (fetched at feather commit 3dc050d97405062eba78aa57115c0a15c63abdaa)

Theme files derived from FreeCAD's own
  files     usr/share/Gui/Stylesheets/overlay/Atech Overlay.qss
            usr/share/Gui/Stylesheets/parameters/Atech Atelier Light.yaml
            usr/share/Gui/Stylesheets/parameters/Atech Atelier Dark.yaml
  derived from FreeCAD 1.1.3's Gui/Stylesheets/overlay/Freecad Overlay.qss
            and Gui/Stylesheets/parameters/FreeCAD Light.yaml / FreeCAD
            Dark.yaml; MODIFIED BY ATECH
  licence   FreeCAD's ("LGPL2+"), (C) the FreeCAD contributors
  licence text usr/share/doc/FreeCAD/LICENSE.html

AppImage type-2 runtime (embedded at the start of the .AppImage file)
  upstream  https://github.com/AppImage/type2-runtime
  version   commit 8f39b89e2ac31e1640b3d3f7e9a5108e6ce805fa (the runtime's own
            string); pinned from 0.1.1 (the exact file 0.1.0 carried)
  licence   MIT — Copyright (c) 2004-23 probonopd
  contains  statically, as the runtime declares itself: libfuse 3.15.0
            (LGPL-2.1), squashfuse 0.5.2 (BSD-2-Clause), musl libc, libzstd
            and zlib (each under the licence at the URL the runtime prints)
  licence text in usr/share/doc/@DOC_NAME@/third_party/:
               LICENSE.type2-runtime (type2-runtime LICENSE at commit 8f39b89),
               LICENSE.libfuse-LGPL-2.1 (libfuse LGPL2.txt at tag fuse-3.15.0),
               LICENSE.squashfuse (squashfuse LICENSE at tag 0.5.2),
               LICENSE.musl (musl COPYRIGHT at tag v1.2.5; the runtime's musl
               version is not determined), LICENSE.zstd (text from zstd
               1.5.7; the runtime's zstd version is not determined).
  source    see SOURCE_OFFER.txt, "AppImage runtime"

Licence texts Atech adds for libraries bundled by FreeCAD
  (FreeCAD's image names these licences but ships no text for them)
  LICENSE.Coin3D    Coin3D 4.0.3, BSD-3-Clause, (c) Kongsberg Oil & Gas
                    Technologies AS (COPYING from the conda-forge coin3d
                    4.0.10 package)
  LICENSE.SoQt      SoQt 1.6.3, BSD-3-Clause, (c) Kongsberg Oil & Gas
                    Technologies AS (COPYING from the conda-forge soqt6 1.6.3
                    package)
  LICENSE.PCL       Point Cloud Library 1.15.0, BSD-3-Clause (LICENSE.txt
                    from the conda-forge pcl 1.15.1 package)
  LICENSE.Xerces-C  Xerces-C 3.3.0, Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE from the
                    conda-forge xerces-c 3.3.0 package)
  LICENSE.LGPL-3.0  the GNU LGPL v3 text (Qt 6, PySide6, IfcOpenShell,
                    pythonocc-core, MPFR/GMP/MPC); copied from
                    usr/share/doc/mpfr/COPYING.LESSER
  LICENSE.GPL-3.0   the GNU GPL v3 text (required with the LGPL v3; also
                    GNU Readline and Qt's GPL-only modules); copied from
                    usr/share/doc/mpfr/COPYING
  all in    usr/share/doc/@DOC_NAME@/third_party/

FreeType (bundled by FreeCAD, used under the FreeType License)
  Portions of this software are copyright (C) 2026 The FreeType Project
  (https://freetype.org). All rights reserved. Atech Atelier is based in
